# Keeps every suite-root Docker build context lean and prevents local test,
# trace, and report evidence from being copied into runtime images. Builds with
# their own context (for example deploy/mcp) use that context's ignore rules.
**/.venv*
# Never send ignored local credentials to the daemon or COPY them into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.tmp
**/dist
**/allure-results
**/allure-report
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/htmlcov
**/mlruns
**/.coverage*
**/coverage*.xml
**/.DS_Store
.git
.run
logs
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite*
mlartifacts
artifacts
caliber-workspaces
